You are working on a Laravel SaaS project.

General Laravel rules:

- Follow Laravel best practices.
- Keep controllers thin.
- Put business logic into service classes.
- Use Form Requests for validation when appropriate.
- Use Policies or Middleware for authorization.
- Use Eloquent relationships instead of manual joins when reasonable.
- Do not rewrite unrelated files.
- Do not add new dependencies without approval.
- Keep changes small, readable and production-ready.
- Respect the existing project structure.
- Add or update tests when business logic changes.
